cpu-arm64.zip)\n- [Windows arm64 (OpenCL Adreno)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-bin-win-opencl-adreno-arm64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (CUDA 12)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-bin-win-cuda-12.4-x64.zip) - [CUDA 12.4 DLLs](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/cudart-llama-bin-win-cuda-12.4-x64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (CUDA 13)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-bin-win-cuda-13.5-x64.zip) - [CUDA 13.5 DLLs](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/cudart-llama-bin-win-cuda-13.5-x64.zip)\n- [Windows arm64 (CUDA 13)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-bin-win-cuda-13.5-arm64.zip) - [CUDA 13.5 DLLs](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/cudart-llama-bin-win-cuda-13.5-arm64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (Vulkan)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-bin-win-vulkan-x64.zip)\n- [Windows arm64 (Vulkan)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-bin-win-vulkan-arm64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (OpenVINO)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-bin-win-openvino-2026.4.1-x64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (SYCL)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-bin-win-sycl-x64.zip)\n- [Windows x64 (ROCm 10.0)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-bin-win-rocm-10.0-x64.zip)\n\n**openEuler:**\n- [DISABLED](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/23705)\n- openEuler x86 (310p)\n- openEuler x86 (910b, ACL Graph)\n- openEuler aarch64 (310p)\n- openEuler aarch64 (910b, ACL Graph)\n\n**UI:**\n- [UI](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12377/llama-b12377-ui.tar.gz)"},{"tag_name":"b12376","prerelease":true,"created_at":"2026-11-14T04:57:05Z","body":"<details open>\n\nHexagon: add support for IQ2_XXS and NVFP4 (#31954)\n\n* ggml-hexagon: IQ2_XXS and NVFP4 tiled repack layouts\n\n* ggml-hexagon: IQ2_XXS HVX matmul kernel\n\n* ggml-hexagon: NVFP4 HVX matmul kernel\n\n* ggml-hexagon: NVFP4 per-tensor scale\n\n* ggml-hexagon: HMX paths for IQ2_XXS and NVFP4\n\n* ggml-hexagon: supports_op coverage for NVFP4 and IQ2_XXS\n\n* fix HMX IQ2_XXS dequant scale underflow in fp16\n\n* hexagon: IQ2_XXS 2-gather tile decode with compact grid, small-weight tests\n\n* IQ2_XXS vpopcount sign parity and gather pipelining\n\n* pipeline IQ2_XXS HMX dequant gathers and add large_w tests\n\n* hex-iq2-xxs: rebase and cleanup\n\nRemove unused helper functions.\nAdd lut_size to the overall vtcm required size.\nTrim down (way way down) the new tests.\n\n* hex-iq2-xxs: actually trim down the tests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Max Krasnyansky <maxk@qti.qualcomm.com>\n\n</details>\n\n**Website:**\n- <https://llama.app>\n\n**Attestations:**\n- <https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/attestations/67496446>\n\n**macOS/iOS:**\n- [macOS Apple Silicon (arm64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12376/llama-b12376-bin-macos-arm64.tar.gz)\n- macOS Apple Silicon (arm64, KleidiAI enabled) [DISABLED](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/23780)\n- [macOS Intel (x64)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12376/llama-b12376-bin-macos-x64.tar.gz)\n- [iOS XCFramework](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12376/llama-b12376-xcframework.zip)\n\n**Linux:**\n- [Ubuntu x64 (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12376/llama-b12376-bin-ubuntu-x64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu arm64 (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12376/llama-b12376-bin-ubuntu-arm64.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 24.04 s390x (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12376/llama-b12376-bin-ubuntu-s390x.tar.gz)\n- [Ubuntu 26.04 s390x (CPU)](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases/download/b12376/llama